{"kind":"table","sheet":"Example","address":"A1:L12","rows":12,"cols":12,"values":[["Example: keep ownership and money separate",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],["Maya, Leo and Sam are moving in together. Maya brings her own kettle. They agree to buy a sofa for 240 USD and split that purchase equally.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],["Room","Item","Decision","Owner or buyer","Expected cost","Actual cost","Currency","Agreed shares","Status","Needed by","Move-out agreement","Notes"],["Kitchen","Kettle","Bring","Maya",null,null,null,"No contribution agreed","Bringing",null,"Maya takes it when she leaves","Existing item; no new expense."],["Living and dining","Sofa — before purchase","Buy","Maya",240,null,"USD","Maya 80; Leo 80; Sam 80","Not started",null,"Discuss and agree before purchase","Planned cost only; nothing recorded as owed yet."],["Living and dining","Sofa — after purchase","Buy","Maya",240,240,"USD","Maya 80; Leo 80; Sam 80","Ready",null,"Review the agreement together at move-out","Maya paid. Leo and Sam each owe Maya 80 USD. Leo later pays 30 USD, leaving 50 USD; Sam still owes 80 USD."],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],["The two sofa rows show stages of the same purchase. In your own planner, update one row instead of entering the purchase twice.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]]}
